WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:32.125
In verse 15.8,

2
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:33.833
Lord Krishna explained

3
00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:35.083
how the soul moves

4
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:36.250
from one body to another,

5
00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:37.916
carrying with it its subtle senses

6
00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:41.833
and sanskaras.

7
00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:44.250
Now He explains that when

8
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.791
the soul obtains a new gross body,

9
00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:51.125
it begins to experience the world

10
00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:54.583
through the mind and senses.

11
00:00:54.583 --> 00:00:57.458
This subtle group of senses, centred
around the mind,

12
00:00:57.458 --> 00:01:01.541
becomes established and active
in the new body.

13
00:01:01.541 --> 00:01:04.083
And according to the conceptions

14
00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:08.041
and desires of past births, the soul once again

15
00:01:08.041 --> 00:01:11.208
begins the cycle of experience and enjoyment.

16
00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:21.583
‘Shrotram chakshuh sparshanam cha
rasanam ghranam va cha.’

17
00:01:21.583 --> 00:01:25.916
The soul receives five senses in the new body –

18
00:01:25.916 --> 00:01:29.541
ears for hearing, eyes for seeing,

19
00:01:29.541 --> 00:01:31.208
skin for touch,

20
00:01:31.208 --> 00:01:35.416
tongue for taste, and nose for smell.

21
00:01:35.416 --> 00:01:37.000
These five senses

22
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.458
serve as the bridge between the soul

23
00:01:39.458 --> 00:01:41.833
and the outer world.

24
00:01:41.833 --> 00:01:45.708
But how do they all work together?

25
00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:48.250
‘Adhishthaya manash chayam.’

26
00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.375
All of them remain under the control

27
00:01:50.375 --> 00:01:53.750
and governance of the mind.

28
00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.666
The mind is their centre.

29
00:01:55.666 --> 00:01:56.875
Just as five fingers

30
00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:58.666
are connected to the palm,

31
00:01:58.666 --> 00:02:01.166
or the spokes of a wheel

32
00:02:01.166 --> 00:02:03.416
are joined to its hub –

33
00:02:03.416 --> 00:02:05.000
in the same way the senses

34
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:09.708
are arranged around the mind.

35
00:02:09.708 --> 00:02:11.750
‘Vishayan upasevate.’

36
00:02:11.750 --> 00:02:14.000
The soul experiences sense-objects

37
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:16.333
through these senses.

38
00:02:16.333 --> 00:02:18.166
It is worth nothing here

39
00:02:18.166 --> 00:02:22.916
that the word sevate also means to serve.

40
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:26.750
We think we are enjoying sense-objects,

41
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:28.166
but in reality

42
00:02:28.166 --> 00:02:30.666
we become their servants.

43
00:02:30.666 --> 00:02:33.333
Bound in the tendencies of the senses,

44
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:34.375
the soul chases sound,

45
00:02:34.375 --> 00:02:39.250
form, taste, smell, and touch.

46
00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.750
Lord Krishna explains

47
00:02:40.750 --> 00:02:43.083
that the soul’s mental tendencies

48
00:02:43.083 --> 00:02:45.041
also determine the form

49
00:02:45.041 --> 00:02:46.833
of its next body.

50
00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:47.875
If a being

51
00:02:47.875 --> 00:02:50.666
only desires to swim,

52
00:02:50.666 --> 00:02:53.375
it receives a fish’s body.

53
00:02:53.375 --> 00:02:56.291
If it has the longing to fly and soar,

54
00:02:56.291 --> 00:02:58.333
a bird’s birth follows.

55
00:02:58.333 --> 00:03:01.500
Thus the new body is not
received by coincidence –

56
00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:03.250
it is shaped by the mind’s vasanas

57
00:03:03.250 --> 00:03:06.083
and aspirations.

58
00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:07.958
Outer enjoyment

59
00:03:07.958 --> 00:03:11.583
is truly a mirror of inner desires.

60
00:03:11.583 --> 00:03:14.916
And until the mind is purified,

61
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:19.625
the soul remains bound in the
same experiences again and again.

62
00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:25.958
Your body,

63
00:03:25.958 --> 00:03:27.041
your senses,

64
00:03:27.041 --> 00:03:31.625
even the circumstances around you –

65
00:03:31.625 --> 00:03:35.708
none of this is without reason.

66
00:03:35.708 --> 00:03:39.416
I have said – the soul, in the new

67
00:03:39.416 --> 00:03:41.583
body, under the mind,

68
00:03:41.583 --> 00:03:43.333
connects with the world.

69
00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:46.375
The situation you are in today

70
00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:48.791
is a reflection of your past thoughts

71
00:03:48.791 --> 00:03:51.541
and desires.

72
00:03:51.541 --> 00:03:56.166
So do not complain.

73
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:59.083
This is the result of the past.

74
00:03:59.083 --> 00:04:03.541
But now you have the opportunity –

75
00:04:03.541 --> 00:04:06.416
to give it a new direction.

76
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:11.875
Your body follows where your mind leads.

77
00:04:11.875 --> 00:04:14.458
When the mind is restless,

78
00:04:14.458 --> 00:04:17.375
the world too seems full of noise.

79
00:04:17.375 --> 00:04:21.083
And when the mind is submerged in pain,

80
00:04:21.083 --> 00:04:24.000
everything feels heavy.

81
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:29.291
The truth is – you can still change

82
00:04:29.291 --> 00:04:32.458
your circumstances and your thoughts.

83
00:04:32.458 --> 00:04:35.916
If you want a brighter future,

84
00:04:35.916 --> 00:04:39.791
build it today through your thoughts.

85
00:04:39.791 --> 00:04:43.208
Choose thoughts that lift you,

86
00:04:43.208 --> 00:04:46.625
feelings that give you strength, and

87
00:04:46.625 --> 00:04:50.875
desires that take you higher.

88
00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:53.916
Change does not come from the outside –

89
00:04:53.916 --> 00:04:56.791
not from changing jobs.

90
00:04:56.791 --> 00:05:00.666
Change begins from within.

91
00:05:00.666 --> 00:05:04.333
The moment the mind is purified, the soul

92
00:05:04.333 --> 00:05:06.583
begins to rise.

93
00:05:06.583 --> 00:05:08.541
And this,

94
00:05:08.541 --> 00:05:11.291
This is true transformation.

95
00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.666
Have you ever wondered

96
00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:21.083
why a small thing at home

97
00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:24.041
becomes a big argument?

98
00:05:24.041 --> 00:05:26.291
Or why the same disagreement

99
00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:30.083
returns again and again in a different form?

100
00:05:30.083 --> 00:05:33.500
This is not only today’s argument –

101
00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:37.333
this is the mind, still carrying the imprint

102
00:05:37.333 --> 00:05:39.708
of past events.

103
00:05:39.708 --> 00:05:43.000
I have said – the soul,

104
00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:45.416
under the mind’s governance,
connects with the world

105
00:05:45.416 --> 00:05:49.791
through the new body and senses.

106
00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:52.791
This means – in the family too,

107
00:05:52.791 --> 00:05:54.875
many of your behaviours are influenced

108
00:05:54.875 --> 00:05:57.458
by the shadow of the past.

109
00:05:57.458 --> 00:06:00.458
Some impressions come from childhood,

110
00:06:00.458 --> 00:06:05.708
and some from much earlier.

111
00:06:05.708 --> 00:06:08.250
You may be speaking to your child,

112
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:12.500
but responding to your own past.

113
00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:16.041
You may be in conflict with your partner,

114
00:06:16.041 --> 00:06:21.000
but the struggle may be with an old fear.

115
00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:24.500
Until you look within,

116
00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:29.291
the past keeps returning to the present.

117
00:06:29.291 --> 00:06:33.541
But here is a hopeful message –

118
00:06:33.541 --> 00:06:37.333
you can break this cycle.

119
00:06:37.333 --> 00:06:40.375
Change begins right there –

120
00:06:40.375 --> 00:06:45.125
the moment you recognise this cycle,

121
00:06:45.125 --> 00:06:46.708
shift your thinking,

122
00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:49.875
and choose a new response.

123
00:06:49.875 --> 00:06:53.041
The more alert the mind,

124
00:06:53.041 --> 00:06:55.583
the more peaceful the home.

125
00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:58.333
Harmony begins not from outside,

126
00:06:58.333 --> 00:07:00.791
but from within.

127
00:07:00.791 --> 00:07:02.083
Reflect on this.

128
00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.708
Your position,

129
00:07:08.708 --> 00:07:12.708
your work, and your struggles –

130
00:07:12.708 --> 00:07:15.833
none of these are accidental.

131
00:07:15.833 --> 00:07:19.916
I have said – the soul, under
the mind’s governance,

132
00:07:19.916 --> 00:07:22.916
connects through the senses.

133
00:07:22.916 --> 00:07:24.416
This means

134
00:07:24.416 --> 00:07:28.208
your career and your current situation

135
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:29.708
are also shaped by your thoughts,

136
00:07:29.708 --> 00:07:33.500
beliefs, and desires.

137
00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:36.166
If you feel stuck

138
00:07:36.166 --> 00:07:39.458
or left behind,

139
00:07:39.458 --> 00:07:43.583
do not only blame the system.

140
00:07:43.583 --> 00:07:45.833
Pause and ask –

141
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:50.458
what thoughts, what expectations,

142
00:07:50.458 --> 00:07:52.833
what goals that hold you back

143
00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:54.583
are working within you?

144
00:07:54.583 --> 00:07:56.041
Your mind

145
00:07:56.041 --> 00:07:57.541
is not merely reacting

146
00:07:57.541 --> 00:07:59.875
to circumstances –

147
00:07:59.875 --> 00:08:03.375
it is constructing your path.

148
00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:07.791
If you want change, begin

149
00:08:07.791 --> 00:08:11.375
not by changing your job or business –

150
00:08:11.375 --> 00:08:14.083
begin by changing your thinking.

151
00:08:14.083 --> 00:08:17.291
Direct your mental energy toward purpose,

152
00:08:17.291 --> 00:08:20.750
clarity, and service.

153
00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.708
When the inner vision changes,

154
00:08:23.708 --> 00:08:25.750
the outer world too

155
00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.125
slowly changes.

156
00:08:29.125 --> 00:08:33.250
Promotion comes later, but peace,

157
00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:37.708
focus, and confidence come first.

158
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:42.250
You are the creator of your
professional journey –

159
00:08:42.250 --> 00:08:45.666
begin from within, and ultimately

160
00:08:45.666 --> 00:08:49.291
the change outside will certainly follow.
